{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:746","content":{"id":746,"title":"卡片","content":[{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"collabId":"4afddd74-93c6-4cd1-8192-c192f041ed11","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"理念"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"104fe62d-83da-4e73-98d0-cb232da5f0cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最初的理念来自于《笔记卡片写作法》这本书，这本书讲的是如何构建卡片盒来帮助你写作，其中关于如何使用卡片盒这种工具去构建你的知识体系让人备受启发，相比于我们常见的自上而下的组织内容，卡片盒是一种自下而上的组织形式，通过卡片之间的关联，自下而上的构建出不同的知识网络，知识体系是自然而然的长出来的，而不是提前规划好的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5aa87bcb-26fe-4149-bd71-b614eed7b7e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一般我们去学习一个领域的时候，比较强调系统学习，从一本书，从一系列课程从头到尾的学习，我们会根据内容大纲创建相应的文件夹，然后在文件夹中记录相应的知识点。这种学习方式的问题是什么呢？那就是过于被动，我们只是在跟随别人的思路在记笔记，在整个的学习过程中无法有效的激活我们的大脑，最明显的现象就是记了就忘，学了白学。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1c7661cd-5e71-4016-a37d-0d1322f56398","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而卡片写作法呢，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"它强调的不是记，而是写作"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，不是直接摘抄书中的内容，或者记录视频的内容，而是使用自己的话对内容进行转述，从自己的话写一遍，从记变为写，就是从被动变为主动，主动将会极大地激活神经元，而同时激活的神经元会形成连接，正是这种神经元之间的连接让我们在需要使用相关知识时能快速的提取出来，而不是记了就忘。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c635b97c-bfcf-4e3d-a303-3b5f68efe36a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外更重要的是"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"它强调卡片之间的联系"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当我们向卡片盒中添加卡片时，一定要先思考这张卡片和卡片盒中的其它卡片之间的关系是什么，并进行连接，随着我们添加的卡片越来越多，卡片之间的联系将会形成网状结构，形成的卡片网络就是卡片自下而上形成的主题，甚至卡片可以跨领域形成连接，帮助我们形成跨领域的洞见。正是这种建立联系的步骤，让我们的卡片盒不会随着卡片数量的增多趋于无序紊乱，反而会因为卡片数量越多，卡片盒更强。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"18ea3a9b-c195-41cd-a800-745536574bab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"卡片笔记能解决很多问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"a4a6bf20-a827-47af-a6a2-ad8a456d843a","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"6c7857a6-972b-4623-bd17-3627786b516a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"114264d6-3dab-4f9e-a294-c569956b5f68","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"降低输入压力。相比于写一篇文章，卡片要求聚焦一个问题，不需要考虑整体的结构，自然而然的把复杂问题进行了拆解，相比于完成一篇结构清晰的文章，输出一张解决某个问题的卡片明显具有更小的压力，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"可以帮助我们快速开始"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"51be3edd-01ae-4b30-b478-45aa3cb19dd8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f3f72c51-524a-4ff2-b198-b3a4d8e777a2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"原子化。原子化不是短，而是"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"一张卡片只承担一个不可再拆的认知判断。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"每一张卡片都可以单独为引用、论证，与其它卡片产生联系。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"4be3048a-5927-4a79-87bf-3fb0f73d469d","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"012e87f9-5359-41e0-81cb-45b50c998f02","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"82d17cde-43e9-4439-8a1f-be4c6de9fa02","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"降低思考模糊。一旦要求你把内容压缩为一个判断，那么关于内容的模糊理解就会立马暴露出来，好像懂了但是却写不出来，它会强迫你将模糊的判断变得清晰，你必须阐述一个明确的观点。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"ff3cb502-cfe7-4435-aeb7-af36904de580","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"27194da3-3590-4fb6-86a4-02164fc64242","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"组合空间指数增长。由于每张卡片都可以和其它卡片产生联系，假设你拥有 50 张卡片，那么你拥有的不是 50 个想法，而是大量的潜在结构，卡片之间的联系可以让你有不同的文章角度，不同的论证路径，不同的主题聚集，随着卡片越来越多，组合的空间是指数级增长，卡片之间的联系会形成你意想不到的论证角度，甚至形成跨领域的联系。"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"1940d910-1fb6-4880-9620-2df3057288f3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"84cdd8e8-f9aa-41cb-9861-696fbfc17d43","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"去情境化。普通笔记和输入来源高度相关，一旦离开上下文，就变得没有意义。而卡片则要求使用自己的话讲述，表达的是一个观点，而不是出处，可以在任意语境中被调用，让笔记成为你的资产而不是书的附属品。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"dd4010c7-fad1-40c8-b6c9-1318e6b39f97","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"56370dd8-85e0-4b22-8824-7ceddece21b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"新的检索方式。不是搜索，而是笔记之间的连接路径。"}]}]}]},{"type":"blockquote","collabId":"c0941a53-b112-4d4f-8d87-88e389354bd4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7ae7ead0-c6c0-4a1f-98ab-072ce78c33d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"日拱一卒无有尽，功不唐捐终入海。"}]}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"collabId":"6d0406d4-6f19-43bb-9756-19d7e2831fa3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"卡片类型"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"27345f2e-0e0b-4759-98f3-98c4d62de320","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"软件支持四种卡片类型："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"4bb059e6-96e2-47ce-9c0a-d752ecb77fc4","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"e2152c6c-674a-4a0b-a0fd-4dbc8290a20d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"08d6bd1c-a79c-41c3-ac52-9fce151f91dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"闪念笔记"},{"type":"formatted","text":"用来记录突然闪现的想法和灵感，及时捕获稍纵即逝的思考火花。这类笔记是临时性的，需要定期回顾并转化为永久笔记。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"999490c3-3d64-4075-942e-9e4389edc2e2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"98374636-07f1-4c43-92ae-83176ed0ef46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"文献笔记"},{"type":"formatted","text":"是阅读文献时，结合文献上下文记录感兴趣或值得记录的内容。用自己的话复述，而不是简单摘抄。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"4e2872f9-2a31-413a-ab78-4a33fa5f154f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c988c539-4cd0-4aac-a28c-c270e6c5294a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​永久笔记"},{"type":"formatted","text":"是卡片盒的核心内容。通过定期回顾闪念笔记和文献笔记，完善想法后形成的永久笔记。每张永久笔记用自己的话表达一个完整的观点，与已有笔记建立联系，能够独立理解（去情境化）。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"958fa30f-0ff0-4a93-9b1a-8d579e61817a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d4f3f1ff-faaa-404e-8dd3-f76c14ff3b16","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"​主题笔记"},{"type":"formatted","text":"围绕特定主题组织，用于汇总和串联相关的永久笔记，形成更大的知识结构。"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"collabId":"3ef76a9f-4122-472c-8fa6-6dfc45e29e4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标签管理"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0bd87c18-48f4-4803-bb23-6210a67d39e6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了解决传统的卡片分类问题，写了一张卡片却不知道放在哪里，既可以放在这里又可以放在那里，本软件采取了通过标签分类的方式，一张卡片可以有多个标签，通过标签自然而然的完成了分类，标签可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"/"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来进行分隔来产生层次关系。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_aaf74510-051d-4b34-9832-37258b47a8d7.webp","uuid":"af78346e-2f89-43fb-889b-be3d0e1c9aa2","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_aaf74510-051d-4b34-9832-37258b47a8d7.webp","width":720,"collabId":"c6abb80a-50e9-44a9-91d7-53f5d0b6b143","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"collabId":"b76d510b-dcfc-435f-a642-cc40c2a6d4e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关系图谱"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"362fc71d-e63c-442a-bb0a-53e07750f54e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"卡片笔记更重要的一件事情是建立卡片之间的联系，可以通过两种方式来引用其它卡片："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"95b93735-467f-4783-8875-084e5a680bfe","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"cfa01c30-72d8-4dfe-a932-257e7431a763","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"832e7a40-f791-4cfc-8d41-22a3ac02e809","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过直接输入 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 然后通过语义搜索来查找关联的卡片"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/May-02-2026%2014-54-25_0e0dba11-34e9-4729-8419-9e04ba182abc.gif","uuid":"ecfa493d-a2d5-420c-82e9-14692c922a11","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/May-02-2026%2014-54-25_0e0dba11-34e9-4729-8419-9e04ba182abc.gif","width":439.555294716628,"collabId":"d81c438b-47da-4aa6-8484-ec0c5b743f76","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"54844385-34bc-4912-9013-4da4d07c587f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"296e85ab-00fd-4c6f-bc61-4ae178adc1b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"选中一段需要关联的文字，在出现的工具栏中选择关联内容，然后搜索内容进行关联"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/May-02-2026%2014-58-40_8eee9f66-7f45-4083-ba7e-e89235c452ef.gif","uuid":"c7790b52-63d4-4aba-ae3b-28296b0cfc9a","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/May-02-2026%2014-58-40_8eee9f66-7f45-4083-ba7e-e89235c452ef.gif","width":439.48182804324716,"collabId":"71b96e0a-9c69-4924-880b-68eb4df4763a","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"aef8ac3c-e5f1-47af-9f00-13c2bce928c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有两种视图可以查看关联的卡片："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"9eb01d9c-c212-47a7-acce-0179e10d402b","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"6c6e9c81-5155-455d-ac2b-5cdd093c6f97","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"69ae4951-40f4-4aea-a21a-8041e4220e94","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"局部视图，在某张卡片的详情页，点击右下角的关联图谱"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5809054d-6240-4f0b-b3c3-2fc253d82129.webp","uuid":"4e0b3f6b-12d7-454d-9077-349095e4c7d6","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5809054d-6240-4f0b-b3c3-2fc253d82129.webp","width":720,"collabId":"479c3ba5-5a5b-4988-a811-95bb97f3959a","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"858660fb-f84d-4aaa-aaf3-704b079287ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看到这样和这张卡片有联系的卡片图谱"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ab95e6cc-cf05-436d-861b-6b26b52dfcb6.webp","uuid":"d4fea24a-8799-49e5-a418-9bfc6a00c580","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ab95e6cc-cf05-436d-861b-6b26b52dfcb6.webp","width":416.893724303415,"collabId":"bbb1793c-cb4b-4aa0-8f0e-13ff5d4a567c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e3669c21-5255-4f34-9501-56f3639daaf4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将鼠标放到相应的节点上就可以到这张卡片的内容，点击就可以跳转到该节点的详情页。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"1636ff5a-49fa-4347-9e1c-b320923737aa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"91bb824c-48f0-4a45-ace0-21939c3cc158","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"全局视角，在卡片列表页面，在关系图谱的 Tab 下可以看到所有卡片的关系图谱"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_06679ccd-d6a6-40f8-8be9-7787a631be97.webp","uuid":"075aecd2-bc84-416c-93db-ec6cc301ae33","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_06679ccd-d6a6-40f8-8be9-7787a631be97.webp","width":720,"collabId":"75e5285c-0217-4886-8398-07f4968b4f40","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"07b9e4cc-6bb7-4841-8f7e-a2fcb9ccd7fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"配合左侧的标签树，可以对选中的标签进行高亮，可以看到某一主题下各节点的连接关系，方便查漏补缺"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_09f32031-75da-47f0-b04a-562db688ac89.webp","uuid":"96ad5182-8ea0-49f6-a1cf-08e8034e4638","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_09f32031-75da-47f0-b04a-562db688ac89.webp","width":720,"collabId":"57e4594d-a9aa-4857-81a2-73f377899d02","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"3d303d7c-8295-4004-a9b0-07bfbeb9b0f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候通过这张方式可以发现你之前认为的两个不相干的主题居然存在联系，这种跨主题的联系有的时候会给你提供一些灵感一些更底层的思考，它们背后遵循着同一套规律。"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"知识管理","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:756","type":"doc","id":756}},{"label":"卡片","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:746","type":"doc","id":746}}],"prevPage":{"title":"知识管理","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:756","type":"doc","id":756}},"nextPage":{"title":"文章","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:747","type":"doc","id":747}},"createTime":1766915323135,"updateTime":1792104937189,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1792104937189}}